{
  "name": "WF-02 · Contact Eligibility & Call Dispatch",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-02 · Call Dispatch\n\n**Credentials needed:**\n- Load Lead + Config, Create Call Attempt, Blocked Audit, Save Execution ID (all Postgres)\n- Bolna: Make Call (Bolna API credential)\n\n**REPLACE after import:**\n- 'Start Result Poller' node: workflowId must point at this file's imported WF-03 workflow (its ID only exists after you import WF-03; copy it from the URL bar and paste into the node, or pick it from the dropdown).\n\n**VERIFIED (checked against the installed n8n-nodes-bolna v0.1.2 source on this machine):** the 'Bolna: Make Call' node's parameters below (resource=call, operation=makeCall, agentId, recipientPhoneNumber, additionalFields.userData) match the real node exactly — it POSTs to /call with body {agent_id, recipient_phone_number, user_data}. TODO still open: the exact response field name holding the new execution id (commonly 'id' or 'execution_id' in Bolna's API) — 'Save Execution ID' below checks both; confirm which one is populated from a real test call and simplify if you like.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky: Credentials & TODO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "start-call",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Start Call Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -40
      ],
      "webhookId": "wf02-start-call"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "lead_id"
            },
            {
              "name": "reason"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Called by WF-05",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Normalize both entry points to a common shape\nconst body = $json.body || $json;\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    lead_id: body.lead_id,\n    reason: body.reason || 'manual'\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Normalize Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        120,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT l.*,\n       EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM appointments ap WHERE ap.lead_id = l.id AND ap.status IN ('requested','confirmed')) AS has_active_appointment,\n       (SELECT jsonb_object_agg(key, value) FROM app_config) AS config,\n       (SELECT row_to_json(p) FROM (SELECT name, location, configurations, price_range, amenities, faqs FROM properties LIMIT 1) p) AS property\nFROM leads l\nWHERE l.id = $1;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [$json.lead_id] }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Load Lead + Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        340,
        40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "32a87679-ef80-4766-b60d-01651c64da42",
          "name": "Rudvaya Supabase Postgres"
        }
      },
      "notes": "CREDENTIAL REQUIRED."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const l = $json;\nconst c = l.config || {};\nconst reason = $('Normalize Input').item.json.reason || 'manual';\n\nconst now = new Date(new Date().toLocaleString('en-US', { timeZone: 'Asia/Kolkata' }));\nconst hhmm = now.toTimeString().slice(0, 5);\nconst allow = (c.call_allowlist || '').split(',').map(s => s.trim());\n\nlet block = null;\nif (!l.consent) block = 'no_consent';\nelse if (l.do_not_contact) block = 'do_not_contact';\nelse if (l.attempt_count >= Number(c.max_attempts)) block = 'max_attempts';\nelse if (hhmm < c.call_window_start || hhmm > c.call_window_end) block = 'outside_call_window';\nelse if (l.has_active_appointment) block = 'appointment_exists';\nelse if (c.demo_mode === 'true' && !allow.includes(l.phone_e164)) block = 'not_in_demo_allowlist';\n\nconst facts = l.property\n  ? `${l.property.configurations}; ${l.property.price_range}; ${l.property.amenities}; ${l.property.faqs}`\n  : '';\n\nconst attemptNumber = (l.attempt_count || 0) + 1;\nconst idempotencyKey = `${l.id}:${reason}:${attemptNumber}`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    ...l,\n    reason,\n    eligible: !block,\n    block_reason: block,\n    property_facts: facts,\n    idempotency_key: idempotencyKey,\n    call_mode: c.call_mode,\n    bolna_agent_id: c.bolna_agent_id\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Eligibility Gate",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        560,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b2000000-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.eligible}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0008-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Eligible?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        780,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "WITH ins AS (\n  INSERT INTO call_attempts (lead_id, mode, reason, idempotency_key)\n  VALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4)\n  ON CONFLICT (idempotency_key) DO NOTHING\n  RETURNING id\n)\nUPDATE leads SET attempt_count = attempt_count + 1, status = 'contacting', updated_at = now()\nWHERE id = $1 AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM ins)\nRETURNING (SELECT id FROM ins) AS call_attempt_id;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [$json.id, $json.call_mode, $json.reason, $json.idempotency_key] }}"
        }
      },
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "id": "b2000000-0009-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Create Call Attempt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        1000,
        -60
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "32a87679-ef80-4766-b60d-01651c64da42",
          "name": "Rudvaya Supabase Postgres"
        }
      },
      "notes": "CREDENTIAL REQUIRED. No row returned = a call for this lead/reason/attempt is already in progress (idempotency)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst callAttemptId = items.length ? items[0].json.call_attempt_id : undefined;\nif (!callAttemptId) {\n  return [{ json: { duplicate: true } }];\n}\nconst eligNode = $('Eligibility Gate').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { duplicate: false, call_attempt_id: callAttemptId, ...eligNode } }];"
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0010-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Merge Attempt Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1220,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "b2000000-0011-4000-8000-000000000011",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.duplicate}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "b2000000-0012-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Already In Progress?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "b2000000-0013-4000-8000-000000000013",
                    "leftValue": "={{$json.call_mode}}",
                    "rightValue": "live_bolna",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "outputKey": "live"
            },
